		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=118&amp;p=343#p343"><![CDATA[
Because of the rapid pace of development and because the Hotspot mode is mostly working in the Tier2 version, I've decided to rename the downloadable files<br><br>I've renamed the last Tier2Latest file to<br><br><strong class="text-strong">OpenGD77_stable.sgl</strong><br><br>and made a new file called<br><br><strong class="text-strong">OpenGD77_latest.sgl</strong><br><br>which now has the very latest changes which have not had much testing and could possibly crash etc, but have the latest features and bug fixes.<br><br>When I know that the <strong class="text-strong">OpenGD77_latest.sgl </strong>has had enough testing and is stable, I"ll copy that version to <strong class="text-strong">OpenGD77_stable.sgl</strong><br><br>So the new location for the stable version is<br><br><strong class="text-strong"><a href="https://github.com/rogerclarkmelbourne/OpenGD77/raw/master/firmware_binaries/daily_builds/OpenGD77_stable.sgl" class="postlink">https://github.com/rogerclarkmelbourne/ ... stable.sgl</a></strong><br><br>and the very latest - not thoroughly tested version is here<br><br><strong class="text-strong"><a href="https://github.com/rogerclarkmelbourne/OpenGD77/raw/master/firmware_binaries/daily_builds/OpenGD77_latest.sgl" class="postlink">https://github.com/rogerclarkmelbourne/ ... latest.sgl</a></strong><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Tue Nov 19, 2019 10:44 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
